{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And they shall be.</b> Yefet says that the faces of the cherubim were toward the cover, toward the center of the cover. In my opinion, the faces of the cherubim were not positioned at the corners; since they stood upright, their faces turned slightly toward the cover."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:17.040503992Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}